# Render   : pass; file=../renders/leaf7--d93487a877.svg
# Fidelity : equivalent
# Features : bracketed, context-free, delayed-expansion, deterministic, fractint-turtle, parametric
# Angle    : 45
# Heading  : 0
# Draw     : F D
# Move     : G M
